# Local headless verification harness (scratch — safe to delete)
.smoke

# Résumé sources and working notes — kept locally, never in the repo.
# The shipped PDF lives in public/ and is the only copy the site needs.
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/` so the exception below can apply: git will not
# descend into a wholesale-excluded directory.
docs/*
# The redaction spec must be in the repo — it is the handoff for sanitising the
# published screenshots before deployment.
!docs/REDACTION.md

# Windows alternate-stream junk that arrives with uploaded files
*:Zone.Identifier
